# TC-E2E-13 configures a USB printer at the Windows share path DEPLOYMENT.md §4 tells
# the installer to set. On a non-Windows build machine that path is not a device, it is
# a relative filename, so printService.send writes the test page into the working
# directory and reports delivered. The junk file was committed once and removed in
# 8f69b4c; this keeps the next `git add -A` from putting it back.
\\\\SHOPPC\\POS-58
